   "atMs": 0,
   "durationMs": 24915,
   "script": "Every time I had to split my pen, I never knew if I was counting the marks right. Nobody ever taught me how, so I am giving you this tip. Inside the OzemPro app I pick the medication I am taking, its concentration, the dose, and it shows me exactly which mark to pull to. No more doing the math myself. Then I log the shot with the spot where I applied it, so I do not lose track next week. I follow the medication level in my body, and I can see how many doses are left in my vial. If you need this help too, tap the link and download OzemPro."
  },
